OL,3,GNEWSAHospital A&E 'under significant
OL,4,Apressure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn A&E department is under "significant
OL,7,Fpressure" as staff see a very high
OL,8,Fnumber of people seeking emergency
OL,9,Fcare, a health chief has said.
OL,11,FDr Mark Roland, chief medical officer
OL,12,Fof Ashford and St Peter's Hospitals in
OL,13,FSurrey, has asked people to use NHS
OL,14,Fservices appropriately.
OL,16,F"Our colleagues are working hard to
OL,17,Fensure people receive the care they
OL,18,Fneed, prioritising our most unwell
OL,19,Fpatients," he said.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
