OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHospital A&E 'under significant
OL,4,Apressure'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"With our emergency department under
OL,7,Fsignificant pressure, we are asking our
OL,8,Flocal community to help by using NHS
OL,9,Fservices appropriately." The trust runs
OL,10,Fa 24-hour A&E at St Peter's Hospital in
OL,11,FChertsey and an urgent treatment centre
OL,12,Fat Ashford Hospital.
